/11162730_1451674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BE9lrk70WtAQ7kNvwGBIzW1&_nc_oc=AdoppeEd3iboy66Q_6Dmv7yV2ZcDn4Gc1o8ziutNvzqYKe_OkVBDM4Pqkd-ocuIP-0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIXoewhRozBhsxAh7GCdwASXHGQ4h0NkbQ3dtUD5hMwPw&oe=6AA410D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJCLeRZi5doQ7kNvwGBOOTT&_nc_oc=AdrY_3Cpvnkc-ig5H6WfYzJzQhj87B2FpcBhxgN-hgHzF3BUCTbeiKuRn84BWO4m8o4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDF3ZDKLDV80crjyCc4e5NtbAzsKNqojeenuOhWwEC2g&oe=6AA41996"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XR8IsipNl6gQ7kNvwG3z9i2&_nc_oc=AdoMx8MMVnu2UAHAY_WlqY19e5cONsgmZeUBs4nM06F2SzSbexEs6JDPujmAzIZMgxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKK8XU5PRCWT5fwe5ONhx3xZMa_aE7LzZUUdCO4aCVpAw&oe=6AA415B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES"